Scaffold a threat.

Usage: opentide new threat [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --name <NAME>
          Object name; the filename is its slug

      --path <PATH>
          File to write, or a folder to write it in (default: the family's objects folder)

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide new threat --name "Credential Dumping"

